{"id":"4b1ba9c576f2","path":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/press-review","lang":"en","title":"USI in the Media","description":"The presence of USI in the media is measured by: a monthly press review, with restricted access to members of the USI community only (for copyright issues). Interested faculty or staff can request access by contacting the Institutional Communication Service (press@usi.ch); repost","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Press","Follow USI"],"image":null,"words":57,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/media/seguici/rassegna-stampa","en":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/press-review"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Press","path":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Follow USI","path":null},{"label":"USI in the Media","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The presence of USI in the media is measured by:</p> <ul> <li>a monthly <a href=\"/en/originalnode/943\">press review</a>, with restricted access to members of the USI community only (for copyright issues). Interested faculty or staff can request access by contacting the Institutional Communication Service (<a href=\"mailto:press@usi.ch\">press@usi.ch</a>);</li> <li>reposting a selection of articles or other media content in the <a href=\"/en/news-events/news\">news</a> section.</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Institutional Communication","href":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Press releases","href":"/en/university/info/press/press-releases"},{"label":"Get to know USI","href":"/en/university/info/press/get-to-know-us"},{"label":"Introduction","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us"},{"label":"USI on Social Media","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/social-media"},{"label":"USI in the Media","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/press-review"},{"label":"Stay in touch","href":"/en/university/info/pre